  "title": "Cheeseburger Meatloaf",
  "description": "This cheeseburger meatloaf is stuffed with Cheddar cheese inside, but it can be substituted with other ingredients, like sautéed onions and mushrooms.",
  "authors": [
    "Douglas Tuccinardi"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-01-08T21:43:40-05:00",
